{
	"$description": "SUPCheckout admin design tokens (spec section 4.1). Tiers: palette (primitives, never used by components), semantic (base for every mode, plus light and dark color and shadow sets), component (aliases of semantic tokens only) and modifiers (Arabic script and compact density overrides). Names flatten to --sup-<path-joined-by-dashes>; {a.b} is an alias rendered as var(--sup-a-b). Reduced motion zeroes every motion-duration-* and motion-distance-* token, and the Arabic scope zeroes every letter-spacing-* token; both are derived by tools/admin-ui/tokens/resolve.mjs. The accent ramp (palette.accent.*) comes from admin-schemes.tokens.json or brand.tokens.json.",
